Feedback provided to OMNI after initial testing. 

RE *motor assist*, OMNI released an IOT firmware update - _48_V1.1.2_, which according to OMNI changed ECO mode to SPORT mode (assumption - lowest assist mode should also be highest always, to eliminate any speed mode selection issues).

RE *battery lock operating* - OMNI responded that they misunderstood the original assignment due to communication issues, and they assumed only IOT-Controller configuration was required, which was the only piece of information shared with them. Luckily, OMNI reportedly should have the protocols for the BLE battery lock, and can integrate their IOT to work with it. ETA is supposed to be EOW15 - {{2024-04-12}}, but unlikely as they are supporting largely with motor assist issues currently.

After FW update to _48_V1.1.2_, the test was conducted once again to validate whether motor assist functionality works.

